ceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Australia Home Sales Rise in Fledgling Sign of Property Recovery", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-07/australia-home-sales-rise-in-fledgling-sign-of-property-recovery", "excerpt": "Australian home sales and auction clearance rates climbed, offering hopes of a recovery for a property market that has slumped as interest rates rose this year.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T23:54:25.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "澳大利亚房屋销售与拍卖清盘率上升，为今年因利率上升而低迷的房地产市场带来复苏初步迹象。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Meta’s $25 Billion Bond Sale Highlights Shifting Landscape for Tech Debt", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-07/meta-s-bond-sale-shows-new-reality-for-tech-debt-credit-weekly", "excerpt": "Selling billions of dollars of corporate bonds on Election Day seemed like a real gamble.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T20:00:00.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "Meta在选举日发行250亿美元公司债，凸显科技企业债务市场格局变化，此举被视为一场风险不小的押注。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Top Turkish Regulators Taken Into Custody in Fund Probe", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-07/turkey-arrests-former-regulatory-executive-in-growing-fund-probe", "excerpt": "Turkish authorities detained top officials from the country’s regulators on Saturday, local media reported, the latest executives to be caught up in a widening fund scandal.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T13:56:55.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "New Chief of Staff, Chain Reaction Tech Selloff", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-07/bloomberg-this-weekend-11-7-2026-video", "excerpt": "The news doesn’t stop when markets close. Hosts David Gura, Christina Ruffini and Lisa Mateo bring clarity, context and a bit of humor to the weekend’s biggest headlines, LIVE from New York. Joined by Yorkville Ives & Co. Partner & Senior Managing Director Dan Ives, Rutgers-Eagleton Center for Publi", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T17:14:41.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "彭博《This Weekend》节目讨论白宫新任幕僚长及科技股连锁抛售，主持人David Gura、Christina Ruffini与Lisa Mateo在纽约直播，嘉宾包括Dan Ives。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Pointed! Bloomberg's Weekly News Quiz For Risk-Takers", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-07/pointed-bloomberg-s-weekly-news-quiz-for-risk-takers-video", "excerpt": "Pointed offers a strategic twist to the news quiz format, testing not just players’ knowledge of the news but also their confidence in their answers. Join Bloomberg's Lisa Mateo, Christina Ruffini and David Gura as they play and check out the quiz for yourself at Bloomberg.com (Source: Bloomberg)", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T15:59:54.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "彭博推出新闻测验节目「Pointed」，除测试新闻知识外还考量答题信心，由Lisa Mateo、Christina Ruffini和David Gura参与。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Berkshire Hathaway Boosts Buybacks as Operating Income Slips", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-07/berkshire-hathaway-s-operating-earnings-fall-buybacks-rise", "excerpt": "Berkshire Hathaway Inc. spent about $9.6 billion to buy back its own shares in the third quarter, a sign the company’s executives viewed the stock as undervalued. But declining insurance underwriting weighed on its operating earnings in a mixed quarter for the company.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T13:01:21.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Ken Chenault on Leadership in an Age of AI", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-07/ken-chenault-on-leadership-in-an-age-of-ai-video", "excerpt": "On Bloomberg This Weekend, General Catalyst Chairman and Managing Director and former American Express CEO Ken Chenault discusses leadership, diversity and responsible AI, arguing that executives need the courage to stand by their values even as political and technological pressures intensify. Chena", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T15:32:55.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "General Catalyst董事长、前美国运通CEO Ken Chenault在彭博节目谈AI时代的领导力、多元化与负责任AI，认为高管需有勇气坚守价值观。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "A Historic First for Women at the Metropolitan Opera", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-07/a-historic-first-for-women-at-the-metropolitan-opera-video", "excerpt": "On Bloomberg This Weekend, composer Missy Mazzoli discusses adapting George Saunders's Lincoln in the Bardo and becoming the first woman composer to have a world premiere at the Metropolitan Opera. Mazzoli tells hosts David Gura and Christina Ruffini how punk helped shape her musical sensibility and", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T15:23:13.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "作曲家Missy Mazzoli成为首位在大都会歌剧院首演作品的女作曲家，她在彭博节目谈改编乔治·桑德斯小说《林肯在中阴》及朋克音乐对其影响。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "How the Iran War Is Making Alaskans Both Richer and Poorer", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-07/inside-alaska-s-oil-paradox-video", "excerpt": "Oil prices have surged across the United States as a result of the ongoing war in Iran. This means higher costs for households in most states, but in Alaska, the state government is bringing in new revenue from its high oil production to offset those higher costs. Some of the revenue is then redistr", "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T15:04:03.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "伊朗战争推高全美油价，多数州家庭成本上升，但阿拉斯加凭借高石油产量获得新财政收入，部分抵消居民成本压力，形成油价的悖论效应。"}], "overview": "美国中期选举结果引发市场连锁反应：民主党胜选被解读为AI监管趋严信号，AI板块先遭抛售后反弹，资金转向亚洲被低估资产；Meta在选举日发行250亿美元债券，伯克希尔加码回购96亿美元。科技侧，OpenAI与Hacktron合作开展漏洞挖掘，并发布湿实验室科学智能体基准；NVIDIA推出Cosmos 3世界模拟模型，Google与Cloudflare在GitHub开源智能体技能工具。时政方面，以色列总统授权反对派领导人艾森科特组阁，内塔尼亚胡执政地位受挫；波兰克拉科夫发生枪击致6死，被总理定性为恐怖袭击；新西兰选举结果胶着，组阁谈判或持续数周。", "market": {"market_overview": "美股方面技术面整体承压：SPY近5日-2.7%、RSI14仅35.1且价格低于sma20/50；QQQ近5日-4.98%、RSI31.4，NVDA距52周高点-23.31%，指数层面均处弱势修复状态；AAPL、MSFT仍维持均线多头排列，但GOOGL、META、TSLA已跌破中期均线，个股分化明显，VIX报25.64、5日大涨32.03%反映波动率抬升。加密方面情绪偏冷却：恐慌贪婪指数28（恐慌），总市值2.56T、24小时-2.85%，BTC主导率59.3%、ETH10.6%；BTC现价75668.67低于sma20（79326）、RSI37.9；ETH RSI39.4但MACD已现金叉；SOL RSI29.9超卖且距52周高点-48.09%。中概股逆势偏强：JD 5日+13.36%且RSI72超买，BABA 5日+11.64%、PDD 5日+5.62%均触发MACD金叉，0700.HK 5日+9.44%但仍在空头排列中。商品外汇方面：黄金4074.9低于sma20/50/200且空头排列，WTI原油5日-12.76%并现MACD死叉，美元指数102.28逼近52周高点、呈多头排列，USDCNY 6.66接近52周低并空头排列；10Y美债收益率4.86、RSI36.9偏弱。", "watchlist": [{"symbol": "JD", "display_name": "京东 (JD)", "stance": "偏上行", "rationale": "5日累计上涨13.36%，价格29.11元站上sma20（26.56）与sma50（26.88），MACD金叉（0.244高于信号-0.1586），动能明显。但RSI14达72已进入超买区，短线指标偏热。"}, {"symbol": "GOOGL", "display_name": "Alphabet (GOOGL)", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "RSI14为29.9已进入超卖，价格284.78低于sma20（317.44）、sma50（332.93）与sma200（339.51），呈空头排列，MACD为-16.58、低于信号-12.79，并出现SMA50下穿SMA200的死叉，技术面明显偏弱。"}, {"symbol": "SOL-USD", "display_name": "Solana (SOL-USD)", "stance": "偏下行", "rationale": "RSI14为29.9处于超卖区，价格89.08低于sma20（98.12）与sma50（107.68），仅略高于sma200（88.99），距52周高点-48.09%，MACD为-4.65低于信号-3.99，空头动量与深回撤并存。"}, {"symbol": "DX-Y.NYB", "display_name": "美元指数 (DXY)", "stance": "偏上行", "rationale": "价格102.28贴近52周高点（仅-0.65%），位于sma20（101.97）、sma50（101.09）、sma200（99.7）之上呈多头排列，RSI14为59，近1日上涨0.72%，趋势与动量指标同向偏强。"}, {"symbol": "BABA", "display_name": "阿里巴巴 (BABA)", "stance": "中性", "rationale": "5日上涨11.64%，价格109.45高于sma20（104.99）但低于sma50（108.29）与sma200（124.64），RSI14为57.7居中，MACD金叉（-1.26高于信号-2.23），短期动能改善但中期均线仍压制，方向未定。"}], "risk_caveat": "本报告仅为基于公开行情数据的技术指标客观解读，不构成任何投资建议或方向预测；过去走势不代表未来表现，指标读数可能快速变化，仅供技术指标解读参考。", "tickers": [{"symbol": "SPY", "displayName": "S&P 500 ETF", "group": "us-equity", "currency": "USD", "exchangeName": "PCX", "currentPrice": 735.29, "pct1Day": 0.31241473396998143, "pct5Day": -2.703378433167104, "pct52WeekHigh": -5.927432767841156, "pct52WeekLow": 16.846236